#X text 1480 504 OUTLET 9 -- track name. The bridge derives it from the stem path in JS (trackNameFromPath) because Max's [regexp] has no vanilla Pd equivalent: regexp_stub is a pass-through that does nothing on outlets 1-4 \, so the old [regexp_stub (/.+)] -> [regexp_stub [^/]+$] chain fed set_track_name the whole path \, or nothing at all. Fires just before loadStemOut \, since slice_writer keys its registry on the name., f 54;
